bottomparticipants

actor User
boundary "Manga Detail Page (UI)" as UI
boundary Router
control UserController
control UserService
control JwtService
control EventEmitter
entity UserModel
database MongoDB

User -> UI: 1. Click Favourite / Unfavourite
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. POST /toggle-favourite
activate Router

Router -> UserController: 3. Toggle favourite
activate UserController
UserController -> UserService: 4. Toggle favourite

activate UserService
UserService -> JwtService: 5. Verify token
activate JwtService

opt Missing token
    JwtService --> UserService: 5.1: Error response
    UserService --> UserController: 5.2. Error response
    UserController --> Router: 5.3. HTTP error response
    Router --> UI: 5.4. HTTP error response
    UI --> User: 5.5. Show error
end

JwtService --> UserService: 6. Decoded
deactivate JwtService
UserService -> UserModel: 7. Find user
activate UserModel
UserModel -> MongoDB: 8. Find user
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> UserModel: 9. Return user
deactivate MongoDB
UserModel --> UserService: 10. Return user
deactivate UserModel

opt User not found
    UserService --> UserController: 10.1. Error response
    UserController --> Router: 10.2. HTTP error response
    Router --> UI: 10.3. HTTP error response
    UI --> User: 10.4. Show error
end


opt Already favourite (REMOVE)
    UserService -> UserService: 11. Remove manga from list
    activate UserService
    space
    deactivate UserService
end

UserService -> UserService: 12. Add manga to list
activate UserService
space
deactivate UserService

UserService -> EventEmitter: 13. Emit favourite count
activate EventEmitter
EventEmitter --> UserService: 14. Return result
deactivate EventEmitter

UserService -> UserModel: 15. Save updated favourites
activate UserModel
UserModel -> MongoDB: 16. Save user
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> UserModel: 17. Saved
deactivate MongoDB
UserModel --> UserService: 18. Save result
deactivate UserModel

UserService --> UserController: 19. Return favourites & isFavourite
deactivate UserService
UserController --> Router: 20. HTTP response
deactivate UserController
Router --> UI: 21. Update favourite state
deactivate Router
UI --> User: 22. Show result
deactivate UI
deactivate User